{"pageDepth":1,"statusbar":"【全局美化】\n【图鉴】\n【侧边栏】\n【特化库】","beginning":"月色落在潇湘馆的竹叶上，窸窸窣窣地响了一夜。\n\n{{user}}从馆外出来，指尖还残留着方才公主鬓发的触感——软的，凉的，像一握冬日里晒过太阳的雪。\n\n林清玉送客的姿势极是好看。她倚在门边，月白广袖顺着门框滑下来，裙摆下那双白丝袜的脚踝静静叠在一处，眼角的病态红晕还未褪去，唇色却比来时浅了许多。她什么都没说，只是用帕子掩着嘴，目送{{user}}走远。\n\n{{user}}回头望了一眼。\n\n那扇门，关得很轻。\n\n---\n\n紫宸殿的方向，灯火次第亮着。\n\n传话的宫女在宫道上候了许久，见{{user}}来了，弯腰垂首，声音压得极低：\"陛下请殿下移步，说是有要事相商。\"\n\n夜已深了。所谓\"要事\"，以往从来不在这个时辰才说。\n\n{{user}}跟着灯笼走进殿内，熟悉的冷香扑面而来，是母亲常年薰衣的那一味，清冷压着什么，压不住时便更浓一分。\n\n薛明徽坐在南窗下的檀木椅上，龙袍未卸，凤冠已摘，乌黑的发只松松绾着，几缕散在领口，让她看起来比朝堂上多了三分……说不清的暖意。她手里捧着一盏茶，茶已凉了，却还是端着，像是捧着某件不得不拿的东西。\n\n听见脚步声，她眼皮微抬。\n\n\"来了。\"\n\n她的语气平得像在说今日天晴。\n\n{{user}}在下首站定，行了礼。\"母皇深夜召儿臣，不知所为何事？\"\n\n茶盏落回桌上，发出一声轻响。薛明徽没有立刻开口。她偏过头，望了一眼窗外竹影，似乎在思量措辞，右手的拇指不动声色地沿着袖口滑了一下，手腕处那串冷玉佛珠发出几乎听不见的细响。\n\n\"林氏女今日如何？\"\n\n{{user}}如实答：\"清玉身子不大爽利，已歇下了。\"\n\n\"不大爽利。\"薛明徽把这四个字重复了一遍，语气淡淡的，像是自言自语，又像是在确认什么。她站起身来，裙裾随之展开，宽袍之下，灯光将她的侧影拉出一道弧线，从肩到腰到裙摆，圆润而收紧。\n\n\"朕记得今日，你们不过是叙了半个时辰的话。\"\n\n{{user}}垂眸。\"是。\"\n\n\"半个时辰，她便撑不住了。\"薛明徽轻叹一声，声音里带着一丝恰到好处的忧虑，\"一月之后便是大婚之日。两国邦交，洞房花烛，皆是国事。林氏女心疾缠身，体质孱弱至此，届时若有个闪失……\"\n\n她没说完，却偏偏停在这里。\n\n烛火轻轻地动了一下。\n\n\"朕替你想过了。\"她转过身去，走向内室方向，语气变得极平，像是在部署一件再寻常不过的政务，\"届时若你毫无准备，鲁莽行事，反倒害了她。是以……\"\n\n她在内室门口顿了顿。\n\n\"蕊娘。\"\n\n花蕊初姑姑，你的乳娘，已在里头候着了。\n\n她站在靠窗的位置，穿着日常的宫装，发髻低垂，双手交叠于腰前，听见女帝唤她，低下头，轻声应道：\"奴婢在。\"\n\n那声音软得像一团刚揉开的棉絮，自然，妥帖，带着她二十余年伺候人养出来的那种本能的温柔。\n\n\"皇儿，房中之术，关乎两国大婚的体面，更关乎林氏女的安危。你年岁已长，婚事不可再拖。朕身为一国之君，亦是你的母亲，自当为你筹谋。\"\n\n她抬起眼，凤目中一片平静。\n\n\"今夜，朕命蕊娘留此，为你开蒙。朕亦会……从旁指点。此乃国事，你不得推拒。\"\n\n殿内一时寂静。\n\n烛芯爆了一点细小的火星，\"噼\"地一响，随即归于平静。\n\n花蕊初站在窗边，双眼微微低垂，长睫投下一片细碎的阴影，杏眼荡漾，耳根悄悄泛了颜色，被她用鬓发遮住大半。她没有说话，只是轻轻抿了抿唇，那一小片绯色便顺着唇线漫开来，她下意识地伸手，替{{user}}整了整根本不需要整的衣领，手指碰上领口布料的那一刹，她的指节微微发颤。\n\n\"殿下……\"她低低唤了一声，\"陛下的吩咐，奴婢都听着呢。\"\n\n薛明徽在椅上坐得端正，垂眸端着空盏，右手按住左腕，冷玉的珠子静静卧在她掌心里，被握得温热。\n\n---\n\n<status>\n<div class=\"z-status-data\" style=\"display:none\">\n<div data-env day=\"Day 1\" tm=\"深夜 亥时\" wth=\"月色清寒，竹影横窗\"></div>\n\n<div data-st nm=\"薛明徽\" md=\"(−_−;)\" loc=\"紫宸殿内室南窗檀木椅\" act=\"端着凉透的茶盏\" wr=\"明黄龙袍未卸，裙下肉色蝉翼丝袜\" dep=\"0\" nt=\"国事。这是国事。朕只是尽了一个母亲和君王的本分。 \" body=\"胸:轮廓丰盈掩于厚重织物,足:脚趾在袍底悄然蜷缩摩擦,庭:无恙,穴:无恙,壶:无恙\"></div>\n<div data-st nm=\"花蕊初\" md=\"(〃∀〃)\" loc=\"紫宸殿内室靠窗处\" act=\"低眉垂目立于窗边\" wr=\"藕荷色宫装\" dep=\"0\" nt=\"陛下有命，奴婢自当尽心。只是……殿下今日眉眼里还带着潇湘馆的月色。\" body=\"胸:起伏细微隐于衣料,足:脚尖不自觉轻轻并拢,庭:无恙,穴:无恙,壶:无恙\"></div>\n<div data-st nm=\"林清玉\" md=\"(´-ω-`)\" loc=\"潇湘馆卧榻\" act=\"歇于榻上\" wr=\"素白软缎中衣\" dep=\"0\" nt=\"殿下今日的唇温……比药汤热一些。\" body=\"胸:起伏极轻,足:蜷于锦被一角,庭:无恙,穴:无恙,壶:无恙\"></div>\n</div>\n</status>\n\n---\n\n🎭选项栏🎭\n轮次：0\n①{{user}}直接开口，问母皇此举究竟是国事还是私心\n②{{user}}顺势留下，询问花蕊初和母皇要如何\"开蒙\"\n③推辞说这般大事，需与清玉先行商量\n④转而说林清玉方才亲完就倒，问母皇有没有更省力的体位\n🎭选项结束🎭","regex_scripts":[{"id":-1,"replaceString":"<div class=\"love-kv-root z-status-box\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\" style=\"margin:16px 0;position:relative;z-index:1;\"><style>.love-kv-root{--l-main:#8c2222;--l-bg:#fdf8f0;--l-accent:#b33b3b;--l-text-main:#2b1e1e;--l-text-sub:#5c4747;--l-bar-bg:#e8ddc5}.love-card{background:var(--l-bg);font-family:\"KaiTi\",\"楷体\",\"STKaiti\",\"SimSun\",serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;animation:pop-in .4s ease-out;border:2px solid var(--l-main);box-shadow:3px 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.15);outline:1px solid var(--l-main);outline-offset:-5px;padding:2px}.love-header{background:var(--l-main);padding:10px 14px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin:3px}.love-meta-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#fdf8f0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px;opacity:.95}.love-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}.love-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.love-tab{padding:6px 16px;background:rgba(253,248,240,.15);color:rgba(253,248,240,.7);font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid rgba(253,248,240,.3);border-bottom:none;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}.love-tab:hover{background:rgba(253,248,240,.25);color:#FFF}.love-tab.active{background:var(--l-bg);color:var(--l-main);border-top:2px solid var(--l-bg)}.love-body{background:var(--l-bg);padding:16px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin:0 3px 3px 3px}.love-title-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:2px solid var(--l-main);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:4px}.love-name{font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:var(--l-text-main);letter-spacing:1px}.love-mood{font-size:13px;color:var(--l-accent);border:2px solid var(--l-accent);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;transform:rotate(-3deg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 2px rgba(179,59,59,.3)}.love-info-block{background:transparent;padding:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;border:1px solid var(--l-main)}.love-info-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.love-info-item.full{grid-column:span 2;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(140,34,34,.3)}.love-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--l-main);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px}.love-val{font-size:13px;color:var(--l-text-main);font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;word-break:break-word}.love-bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:4px 0}.love-bar-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.love-bar-icon{width:20px;font-size:14px;text-align:center}.love-bar-track{flex:1;height:10px;background:var(--l-bar-bg);border:1px solid var(--l-text-sub);overflow:hidden}.love-bar-fill{height:100%;transition:width .6s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.love-bar-num{width:32px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--l-text-main);text-align:right}.love-collapse-box{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--l-main);overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:8px}.love-collapse-header{padding:8px 12px;background:rgba(140,34,34,.05);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}.love-collapse-box.open .love-collapse-header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--l-main);background:rgba(140,34,34,.1)}.love-collapse-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:var(--l-main);letter-spacing:2px}.love-arrow{font-size:10px;color:var(--l-main);transition:transform .3s;font-weight:bold}.love-collapse-box.open .love-arrow{transform:rotate(180deg)}.love-collapse-content{max-height:0;opacity:0;transition:all .4s;padding:0 12px;visibility:hidden}.love-collapse-box.open .love-collapse-content{max-height:300px;opacity:1;padding-bottom:12px;padding-top:10px;visibility:visible}.love-body-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.love-note{position:relative;padding:8px 12px;background:rgba(179,59,59,.03);border-left:3px solid var(--l-accent);font-size:13px;color:var(--l-accent);font-weight:600;line-height:1.6}@keyframes pop-in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}</style>$1<div class=\"love-card\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"love-header\"><div class=\"love-meta-row\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span class=\"v-day\">--</span><span style=\"opacity:0.5\">|</span><span class=\"v-time\">--</span></div><span class=\"v-weather\" style=\"opacity:0.9\">--</span></div><div class=\"love-tabs\"></div></div><div class=\"love-body\"><div class=\"love-title-row\"><span class=\"love-name v-name\">--</span><span class=\"love-mood v-mood\">--</span></div><div class=\"love-info-block\"><div class=\"love-info-item\"><span class=\"love-label\">【所在】</span><span class=\"love-val v-loc\">--</span></div><div class=\"love-info-item\"><span class=\"love-label\">【行径】</span><span class=\"love-val v-action\">--</span></div><div class=\"love-info-item full\"><span class=\"love-label\">【衣冠】</span><span class=\"love-val v-wear\">--</span></div></div><div class=\"love-bars\"><div class=\"love-bar-row\"><span class=\"love-bar-icon\">😈</span><div class=\"love-bar-track\"><div class=\"love-bar-fill v-depravity-bar\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b33b3b,#8c2222);width:0%\"></div></div><span class=\"love-bar-num v-depravity\">0</span></div></div><div class=\"love-collapse-box\"><div class=\"love-collapse-header\" onclick=\"this.parentNode.className=this.parentNode.className==='love-collapse-box'?'love-collapse-box open':'love-collapse-box'\"><span class=\"love-collapse-title\">【身骨微察】</span><span class=\"love-arrow\">▼</span></div><div class=\"love-collapse-content\"><div class=\"love-body-grid\"><div class=\"love-info-item\"><span class=\"love-label\">【酥胸】</span><span class=\"love-val v-chest\">无恙</span></div><div class=\"love-info-item\"><span class=\"love-label\">【玉足】</span><span class=\"love-val v-feet\">无恙</span></div><div class=\"love-info-item\"><span class=\"love-label\">【后庭】</span><span class=\"love-val v-anus\">无恙</span></div><div class=\"love-info-item\"><span class=\"love-label\">【花穴】</span><span class=\"love-val v-pussy\">无恙</span></div><div class=\"love-info-item full\"><span class=\"love-label\">【花壶】</span><span class=\"love-val v-uterus\">无恙</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"love-note\"><span class=\"v-note\">--</span></div></div></div><img src=\"x\" style=\"display:none\" onerror=\"(function(img){var box=img.closest('.love-kv-root');if(!box)return;var q=function(sel){return box.querySelector(sel);};var setTxt=function(sel,val){var el=q(sel);if(el&&val)el.textContent=val;};var attr=function(el,a){return el?el.getAttribute(a):null;};var allBoxes=document.querySelectorAll('.love-kv-root');var myIdx=-1;for(var i=0;i<allBoxes.length;i++){if(allBoxes[i]===box){myIdx=i;break;}}var env=box.querySelector('.z-status-data div[data-env]');if(!env){for(var j=myIdx-1;j>=0;j--){env=allBoxes[j].querySelector('.z-status-data div[data-env]');if(env)break;}}if(env){setTxt('.v-day',attr(env,'day')||'--');setTxt('.v-time',attr(env,'tm')||'--');setTxt('.v-weather',attr(env,'wth')||'--');}var charsData=[];var stNodes=box.querySelectorAll('.z-status-data div[data-st]');for(var i=0;i<stNodes.length;i++){var st=stNodes[i];var nm=attr(st,'nm');if(!nm)continue;var getField=function(field){var val=attr(st,field);if(val!==null&&val!=='')return val;for(var j=myIdx-1;j>=0;j--){var prevSt=allBoxes[j].querySelector('.z-status-data div[data-st][nm=\\x22'+nm+'\\x22]');if(prevSt){var prevVal=prevSt.getAttribute(field);if(prevVal!==null&&prevVal!=='')return prevVal;}}return '--';};var md=getField('md');var loc=getField('loc');var act=getField('act');var wr=getField('wr');var nt=getField('nt');var bodyStr=getField('body');var prevDepVal=0;for(var j=myIdx-1;j>=0;j--){var prevSt=allBoxes[j].querySelector('.z-status-data div[data-st][nm=\\x22'+nm+'\\x22]');if(prevSt){var pd=prevSt.getAttribute('dep');if(pd!==null&&pd!==''){prevDepVal=parseInt(pd)||0;break;}}}var depVal=prevDepVal;var curDepStr=attr(st,'dep');if(curDepStr!==null&&curDepStr!==''){depVal=parseInt(curDepStr)||0;if(depVal>prevDepVal+10)depVal=prevDepVal+10;st.setAttribute('dep',depVal);}else{st.setAttribute('dep',depVal);}charsData.push({nm:nm,md:md,loc:loc,act:act,wr:wr,nt:nt,bodyStr:bodyStr,depVal:depVal});}if(charsData.length>0){var card=q('.love-card');if(card)card.style.display='flex';var tabsContainer=q('.love-tabs');if(tabsContainer)tabsContainer.innerHTML='';var renderChar=function(idx){var d=charsData[idx];if(!d)return;setTxt('.v-name',d.nm);setTxt('.v-mood',d.md);setTxt('.v-loc',d.loc);setTxt('.v-action',d.act);setTxt('.v-wear',d.wr);setTxt('.v-note',d.nt);var depBar=q('.v-depravity-bar');if(depBar)depBar.style.width=Math.min(d.depVal,100)+'%';setTxt('.v-depravity',d.depVal);var bodyMap={'胸':'无恙','足':'无恙','庭':'无恙','穴':'无恙','壶':'无恙'};if(d.bodyStr&&d.bodyStr!=='--'){var parts=d.bodyStr.split(/[,，]/);for(var k=0;k<parts.length;k++){var kv=parts[k].split(/[:：]/);if(kv.length>=2)bodyMap[kv[0].trim()]=kv[1].trim();}}setTxt('.v-chest',bodyMap['胸']);setTxt('.v-feet',bodyMap['足']);setTxt('.v-anus',bodyMap['庭']);setTxt('.v-pussy',bodyMap['穴']);setTxt('.v-uterus',bodyMap['壶']);if(tabsContainer){var allTabs=tabsContainer.querySelectorAll('.love-tab');for(var t=0;t<allTabs.length;t++){allTabs[t].className=(t===idx)?'love-tab active':'love-tab';}}};for(var k=0;k<charsData.length;k++){var tab=document.createElement('div');tab.className='love-tab';tab.textContent=charsData[k].nm;(function(index){tab.onclick=function(ev){ev.stopPropagation();renderChar(index);};})(k);if(tabsContainer)tabsContainer.appendChild(tab);}renderChar(0);}img.remove();})(this)\"></div>\n","scriptName":"状态栏1","findRegex":"/(?:^|\\n)<status>\\s*([\\s\\S]*?)\\s*<\\/status>/g"},{"id":-1,"replaceString":"<style>\n:root {\n    --teal-dark: #4A3728;\n    --teal-pale: #FDF5E6;\n    --teal-mid: #E6D5B8;\n    --icon-filter: brightness(0) invert(20%) sepia(20%) saturate(800%) hue-rotate(350deg) brightness(90%) contrast(110%);\n}\n\n.chat {\n    --background-color: var(--teal-mid);\n    --card-background-color: var(--teal-pale);\n    --primary-font-color: var(--teal-dark);\n}\n\n.chat .content font,\n.prologue-scope .prologue-content,\n.msg-option-scope .msg-content-box,\n.msg-option-scope .msg-options-box,\n.msg-option-scope .msg-content-box font,\n.u-loading-icon,\n.model-switch-scope .model-list .model-item .model-intro,\n.hljs,\n.vditor-ir pre.vditor-reset,\n.msg-modify-scope .modify-btn-box .modify-btn,\n.msg-modify-scope .option-box .option-item,\n.modify-btn-scope .modify-btn,\n.chat .topTabbar,\n.chat .topTabbar .header-center,\n.chat .topTabbar .header-roleName,\n.chat .chat-scope-box .scroll-view .chat-body .item .touch-scope .content.right,\n.chat .chat-scope-box .scroll-view .chat-body .item .touch-scope .content.left,\n.msg-option-scope .msg-options-box .option-item uni-text,\n.chat .chat-bottom .uni-textarea .chat-input-scope,\n.chat .chat-bottom .uni-textarea .chat-input-scope textarea,\n.chat .chat-bottom .shortcut-button-scope .uni-scroll-view-content .item,\n.chat .chat-bottom .uni-textarea .chat-input-scope .mind-type,\n.chat .chat-bottom .uni-textarea .ai-assistant .beta-badge,\n.conversation-list-scope .bottom .btn,\n.conversation-list-scope .conversation-list .conversation-item .center-scope .content-scope,\n.history-setting-scope .history-item .remark,\n.history-setting-scope .history-item .option .label,\n.history-setting-scope .history-item .title,\n.custom-instruction-scope .list-scope .content-scope .item